, \"description\": \"Understanding containers, writing Dockerfiles, managing container images, and local orchestration.\"}, {\"week\": \"Week 9–10\", \"topic\": \"Infrastructure as Code (IaC) & Automation\", \"description\": \"Automating infrastructure provisioning, managing state configuration, and setting up pipelines.\"}, {\"week\": \"Week 11\", \"topic\": \"CI/CD Pipelines, Monitoring & Security\", \"description\": \"Building automated deployment pipelines, application logging, monitoring tools, and access controls.\"}, {\"week\": \"Week 12\", \"topic\": \"Production-Grade Capstone Deployment & Architecture Review\", \"description\": \"Deploying a resilient, auto-scaling application architecture and final presentation.\"}]');
